Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:03.60,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Back to back wins on the tour.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N巡回赛取得连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:05.67,TL,,0,0,0,,救点有亮点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:08.37,TL,,0,0,0,,发球局的压力却始终没退
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:10.43,TL,,0,0,0,,月亮姐{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:12.51,TL,,0,0,0,,止步中网第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:17.14,TL,,0,0,0,,北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}2{\fs68}日中午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.99,TL,,0,0,0,,中网女单第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.99,0:00:21.65,TL,,0,0,0,,赫瓦林斯卡 球迷叫她月亮姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:24.25,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是亚斯特雷姆斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:34.12,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘追回两局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:38.15,TL,,0,0,0,,对手上网截击 抢走相持的空间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.15,0:00:40.31,TL,,0,0,0,,月亮姐随后救下{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:42.07,TL,,0,0,0,,追成{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:45.51,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a good volley from Yastremska.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚斯特雷姆斯卡截击打得好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:48.17,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's got herself more break points here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她又拿到了破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.43,0:00:51.12,TL,,0,0,0,,从{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后 到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.53,TL,,0,0,0,,她把首盘拉了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.53,0:00:55.07,TL,,0,0,0,,接下来还要顶住发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:06.01,TL,,0,0,0,,底线相持 她被拉出中路 再赶回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:08.50,TL,,0,0,0,,这个发球局还是丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.29,0:01:17.43,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there is the break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一局被破发了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.73,0:01:21.72,TL,,0,0,0,,来到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 她先救下两个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:25.37,TL,,0,0,0,,现在是占先 这个发球局终于留下了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:31.81,TL,,0,0,0,,两个盘点救回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.81,0:01:33.80,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘却没能留下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.80,0:01:35.68,TL,,0,0,0,,对手拿到第三个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:37.97,TL,,0,0,0,,以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}结束首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.07,0:01:40.51,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Statement hold of serve{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一局保发很强势
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:41.89,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to see out the opening set there{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也由此拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:42.91,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from Dayana Yastremska.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚斯特雷姆斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.03,0:01:45.91,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Really impressive first set performance.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘表现令人印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:49.23,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A little blip after initially going ahead.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N开局领先后曾有一点波折
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:51.78,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘发球承压
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:53.38,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:56.52,TL,,0,0,0,,接下来她的两个发球局接连失守
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:01:58.82,TL,,0,0,0,,一发得分率降到{\fs78}39{\fs68}%
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:00.78,TL,,0,0,0,,比分开始被拉开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.51,0:02:07.67,TL,,0,0,0,,对手这一盘先连赢{\fs78}4{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.67,0:02:10.12,TL,,0,0,0,,她随后保发追到{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:12.13,TL,,0,0,0,,全场制胜分{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}47{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:15.13,TL,,0,0,0,,少失误也补不回进攻差距
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.19,0:02:19.05,TL,,0,0,0,,她的非受迫失误更少
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:21.39,TL,,0,0,0,,对手主动得分却更多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.39,0:02:24.46,TL,,0,0,0,,救点的韧劲 仍值得记住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:28.07,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.07,0:02:30.26,TL,,0,0,0,,月亮姐继续在底线左右移动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:31.63,TL,,0,0,0,,接住相持
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:33.26,TL,,0,0,0,,救下盘点有亮点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:34.90,TL,,0,0,0,,但全场{\fs78}8{\fs68}个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.90,0:02:36.77,TL,,0,0,0,,她有{\fs78}5{\fs68}局没能守住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:39.31,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}告负
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:41.80,TL,,0,0,0,,下一站 她能把救点的韧劲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:44.38,TL,,0,0,0,,变成更多主动得分吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:50.12,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Back to back wins on the tour.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N巡回赛取得连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:56.64,TL,,0,0,468,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For the first time since January for Dayana Yastremska.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她自{\fs78}1{\fs68}月以来首次取得连胜
